               <p xml:id="idm190">The song was written for a joint concert of Studentersangforeningen in Copenhagen and Lunds Studentsångare on 17 November 1856 in aid of the planned new building for Studenterforeningen, which was not inaugurated until 1863. It was performed again at the 40th anniversary of Studenter-Sangforeningen in 1879, at which event it substituted the National Anthem at the beginning of the concert.</p>
            </history>
